# ANDRITZ ISC - Tool Management System (TMS)
# Konfigurasi Endpoint Backend API

# 1. Saat running di localhost (Laragon):
# Default otomatis mengarah ke http://localhost/TMS-ISC/api
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost/TMS-ISC/api"

# 2. Saat di-hosting di Vercel:
# Jika Anda menghubungkan ke database MySQL online (misal: hosting cPanel, Railway, Render, TiDB, atau Ngrok):
# Isi dengan URL publik backend Anda:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://api-tms-anda.domain.com/api"
